ke care of it  that only meant that we shut down  production which we did we went back to  the drawing board for over a week and  eventually we came up with a solution  that according to Owen  worked on camera but it took a lot of  courage for Owen to contradict a  director in front of the actor that's  not something you're really supposed to  do ever and it's a tribute to the  breadth of Owens great talent that he  was able to see both the problem and  envision a solution and the  cinematographer who knows as much about  makeup as about focal length and depth  of field is oscar-worthy in my book  congratulations on for sharing with us  this richly deserved honor and thank you  for sharing with us your remarkable gift  ladies and gentlemen this is for Owen  [Applause]
 

